<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN WHOLESALE AND RETAIL TRADE UP IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN WHOLESALE AND RETAIL TRADE UP IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's wholesale trade rose by 13 percent and retail trade by 15 percent in March compared to the same period last year, the country's statistics office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Wholesale trade was 3.6 billion kroons and retail trade 1.6 billion kroons in March, the office added in a statement.</p>
<p>During the first quarter, wholesale trade amounted to 10.3 billion kroons and retail trade was 4.3 billion kroons.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
